Fix Supabase DB issues:

## 1. Auth RLS (71 policies - CRITICAL)
Wrap `auth.<function>()` with `(select auth.<function>())` to prevent per-row eval.
Tables: users(3), households(3), tasks(5), polls(3), shopping_items(4), household_events(4), expenses(4), notifications(3), household_invitations(3), calendar_connections(4), poll_options(2), poll_votes(4), poll_comments(4), meals(4), task_comments(4), meal_ingredients(4), shopping_item_comments(4), user_settings(3)
Example: `auth.uid() = user_id` → `(select auth.uid()) = user_id`

## 2. Merge Duplicate Policies (3 tables)
households (SELECT): "Users can view households by invite code" + "Users can view their own household"
tasks (UPDATE): "Adults can update tasks" + "Assigned users can mark tasks complete"  
users (SELECT): "Users can view household members" + "Users can view their own profile"

## 3. Create Missing FK Indexes (10)
CREATE INDEX idx_expenses_paid_by_user_id ON expenses(paid_by_user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_household_invitations_invited_by_user_id ON household_invitations(invited_by_user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_meals_assigned_to_user_id ON meals(assigned_to_user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_meals_created_by_user_id ON meals(created_by_user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_poll_comments_user_id ON poll_comments(user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_poll_votes_option_id ON poll_votes(option_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_polls_created_by_user_id ON polls(created_by_user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_shopping_item_comments_user_id ON shopping_item_comments(user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_shopping_items_purchased_by_user_id ON shopping_items(purchased_by_user_id);
